                  Asia to support malaria control and elimination},
  author       = {Jacob, Christopher G and Thuy-Nhien, Nguyen and Mayxay,
                  Mayfong and Maude, Richard J and Quang, Huynh Hong and
                  Hongvanthong, Bouasy and Vanisaveth, Viengxay and Ngo Duc,
                  Thang and Rekol, Huy and van der Pluijm, Rob and von Seidlein,
